PROVENANCE AND ATTRIBUTION
11/12: Midnight Pumpkin Harvest and Raven Manor, original vector
illustrations created for the theme in 2026, without photographs or external
assets. Their contact sheets use the system sans-serif font for labels;
no font files are redistributed.

13/14: The Last Corridor and Don't Look at the Glass, fictional scenes
generated with FLUX.1 [schnell] through the official public Black Forest Labs
Space. They are not photographs of real people. Prompts, seeds, versions
and parameters are in sources/13-14-generated.json. The 2048x1152 WebPs are
the provider's originals, without upscaling, conversion, retouching or
recomposition. The comparison contact sheet does reduce their size.

optional/halloween-jumpscare.webm is a silent animated derivative of 13/14,
with scaling, a brief zoom, a cut and a fade. The same qualified CC0
dedication applies to the project's contribution to this derivative.
Its source hashes and production parameters are documented in
sources/optional-jumpscare.json.

The FLUX.1 [schnell] model is released under Apache-2.0:
https://bfl.ai/blog/24-08-01-bfl
Model weights are not redistributed. The model license does not guarantee
exclusivity or copyright protection for its outputs. The CC0 dedication
for 13/14 is limited to rights that may exist in the contribution of this
project's authors; no third-party rights are claimed.

